    "stdout.txt": "IGNORE的值 -100\n整段log分數 -0.4791\n還原機率 0.6193\nvalid [[False, True, True]] safe_labels [[0, 0, 2]]\n每個位置取出的log機率 [-2.2395, -0.2395, -0.2395]\n",
